# Git: commit and push automatically

After finishing a set of project changes, commit them and `git push origin HEAD` without asking.

- Do not ask “want me to push?”
- Do not force-push or skip hooks
- Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials)
- If there is nothing to commit, skip the commit; still push if the branch is ahead of origin
- Use a short commit message that matches this repo’s style
